# `cq`'s measured input and output. `examples/cq/README.md` says how to make
# them: they are generated from a seed rather than checked in, because a
# hundred thousand records is seventeen megabytes and a repository is a bad
# place to keep one.
cq/data/bookings-large.jsonl
cq/data/confirmed-large.jsonl
cq/data/summary-large.csv

# `cq.sample` writes here when it is run without a path, because that is
# where the `files` capability is rooted from `examples/`. Same file, same
# reason as the three above: generated from a seed, too large to keep.
files/bookings-large.jsonl

# Scratch output from a profiling run; `examples/cq/README.md` says how.
cq/data/prof.csv
